src/Entry.p
  Derived from Tickit::Widget::Entry (based on version 0.42).
  Printable-key bindings for Nama's terminal entry widget.

src/Completion.p
  Derived from Tickit::Widget::Entry::Plugin::Completion (based on version 0.02).
  Directory completion keeps trailing slashes free of appended spaces; unique matches do not open the candidate popup.

src/ScrollerItemText.p
  Derived from Tickit::Widget::Scroller::Item::Text (based on version 0.33).
  Suppress uninitialized-value warnings while laying out scroller text.

src/EntryItem.p
  Derived from Tickit::Widget::Scroller::Item::Text (based on version 0.32).
  Adapt the text scroller item to the Tickit::Widget::Scroller::Item::Entry class for Nama.

